  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Challenge Fund for Youth Employment project in Uganda, creating, matching or improving the jobs of 604 youth with disabilities. The project will match 30 youth with jobs with companies in Uganda, support 560 youth into self-employment through inclusive enterprise groups and improve the jobs of 14 disability inclusion facilitators.</narrative>
  </description>
